    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If it's M/M you're worried about, we took care of that last night."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We are looking for a"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'd also appreciate it if you could be a bit more cautious in the future."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "IT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...it's gone."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "WHAT IS GONE?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "TH-THE AMOUNTS DON'T ADD UP."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's just a tiny bit short... but..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You're positive?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "TINK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"here... in my hand...\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Shik shik"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hollow."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Skiish"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Pop"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"forty-two westwood, Los Angeles...\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Chak"
